    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "PROPERTY PARTNERS O’ BRIEN SWAINE are delighted to present  No. 6 Carleton Road, an impressive and generously proportioned three-bedroom family residence with the added benefit of a superb attic conversion, ideally positioned on this mature and highly regarded residential road in the heart of Marino.\r\nBehind its attractive façade, the property offers spacious and versatile accommodation, thoughtfully arranged to meet the demands of modern family living. The generous living accommodation is complemented by an extended kitchen to the rear, creating a wonderful space for everyday family life and entertaining alike.\r\nFurther enhancing the appeal of this exceptional home is a driveway to the front, convenient side access and a delightful west-facing rear garden, providing a private outdoor setting that enjoys afternoon and evening sunshine.\r\nThe location is second to none, enjoying the tranquility and strong sense of community for which Marino is renowned, while remaining within easy reach of the vibrant amenities of Clontarf and Fairview. Dublin Bay is also nearby, offering an abundance of scenic walks and recreational opportunities, while excellent schools, shops, cafés and transport links are all close at hand.\r\nCombining generous proportions, excellent outdoor space and an enviable location, No. 6 Carleton Road represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a distinguished family home in one of Dublin 3’s most desirable residential neighbourhoods.\r\nAccommodation includes: Porch, Entrance hall, diningroom, livingroom, kitchen, 3 bedrooms, bathroom and attic conversion"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch: 1.1m x 0.9m\r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: 4.4m x 2.1m\r\nSolid timber flooring, alarm panel, spotlights, storage press, boiler room plumbed with gas boiler\r\n\r\nKitchen: 6.4m x 2.3m\r\nWall and floor mounted units, tiled floors and splashback, integrated oven, hob and extractor fan, plumbed for stainless steel sink unit, dishwasher and washing machine , access to under stairs storage , door to rear garden\r\n\r\nLivingroom: 4.5m x 3.3m\r\nSolid timber flooring, spotlights, feature fireplace (solid fuel), built in storage, TV point, patio door to rear garden\r\n\r\nDiningroom: 3.0m x 3.3m\r\nSolid timber flooring, built in storage, spotlights\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\n\r\nLanding: 2.1m x 3.1m\r\nCarpet\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3.1m x 2.1m\r\nWood effect flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom: 1.6m x 2.9m\r\nFully tiled, WC, WHB, Bath and shower, wall mounted mirror, built in storage, spotlights\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.0m x 3.9m\r\nWood effect flooring, feature fireplace\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 4.5m x 3.9m\r\nWood effect flooring, built in wardrobes, hotpress, spotlights\r\n\r\nAttic: 6.1m x 3.1m\r\nCarpet, Velux window, spotlights, built in shelving, access to eves storage\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nFront: Driveway , EV charger, access to rear\r\nRear : Fully walled, paved and cobblelocked, Barna shed, raised planting"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
